---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" ogTitle="About" ogDescription="Learn more about Freely Given Books and its mission.">
  <h1>About</h1>

  <p>Welcome to Freely Given Books, a collection of freely available Christian literature.</p>

  <h2>Mission</h2>
  <p>
    Our mission is to make Christian books freely available to everyone. All books in our library are
    in the public domain or released under Creative Commons licenses.
  </p>

  <h2>Formats</h2>
  <p>We provide books in multiple formats to suit your reading preferences:</p>
  <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 g-2 mb-3">
    <div class="col d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
      <span class="btn btn-success btn-sm" style="min-width:7rem;pointer-events:none;">Read Online</span>
      <span>Some books can be read directly in your browser on a webpage!</span>
    </div>
    <div class="col d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
      <span class="btn btn-outline-success btn-sm" style="min-width:7rem;pointer-events:none;">Leer en línea</span>
      <span>Spanish editions you can read in your browser.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="col d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
      <span class="btn btn-danger btn-sm" style="min-width:7rem;pointer-events:none;">PDF</span>
      <span>Free printable PDF for reading on any device or to print at home.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="col d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
      <span class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" style="min-width:7rem;pointer-events:none;">eBook</span>
      <span>EPUB downloads for e-readers and mobile devices.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="col d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
      <span class="btn btn-info btn-sm" style="min-width:7rem;pointer-events:none;">Mobi</span>
      <span>MOBI downloads for older Kindle devices.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="col d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
      <span class="btn btn-warning btn-sm" style="min-width:7rem;pointer-events:none;">Print</span>
      <span>High-quality PRINT editions available for purchase.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="col d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
      <span class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" style="min-width:7rem;pointer-events:none;">Print Ready</span>
      <span>A ZIP file with a PDF and a COVER formatted for home or professional printing.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="col d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
      <span class="btn btn-word btn-sm" style="min-width:7rem;pointer-events:none;">Word</span>
      <span>An editable Word document (.docx).</span>
    </div>
    <div class="col d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
      <span class="btn btn-audiobook btn-sm" style="min-width:7rem;pointer-events:none;">Audiobook</span>
      <span>Listen to the book read aloud.</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Printable PDFs</h2>
  <p>
    Our goal is to provide a PDF that you can take to any printer and print yourself. If you want a
    custom version, or need to use a different printer than the one already used, you are free to do so.
  </p>

  <h2>License</h2>
  <p>
    All books are licensed under CC0 (Creative Commons Zero) or public domain, which means they are
    free to read, share, and distribute.
  </p>
  <p>
    Please consider donating to the various authors and contributors so that they can continue the work.
    There is absolutely NO OBLIGATION that you do so, but "the worker is worthy of his wages."
  </p>

  <div class="mt-4">
    <a href="/library" class="btn btn-primary">Browse Our Library</a>
  </div>
</Base>
